unused-mock (hygiene, default info)
A module mock or spy in a test file disagrees with what the file imports or reads, so nothing uses it.
Status
  verdict      INSUFFICIENT
  tier         experimental: shown only with --all (the default view needs ≥15 decided and shown precision ≥0.80)
  precision    none decided
  decided      0 true, 0 false
  measured on  no corpus entry recorded
  proven bar   Wilson lower bound ≥ 0.9 on the pooled dev sample: ≥35 decided with 0 false, ≥53 with 1, ≥69 with 2 (docs/rule-visits/README.md)
  advisory     an unproven rule reports at info and never fails the build unless .spirolorc raises its severity; a DROPPED or FAIL rule never gates
  docs         docs/rules/unused-mock.md
